{"index": 1, "question": "Transformer 的编码器由什么结构组成？每层包含哪些子层，编码器共有多少层？", "answerable": true, "expected_documents": ["attention-is-all-you-need.pdf"], "expected_pages": [3], "reference_answer": "编码器由 N=6 个相同层堆叠组成；每层含多头自注意力子层和逐位置前馈网络子层，每个子层外有残差连接与 LayerNorm；d_model=512。", "expect": "answer", "mode": "deep", "max_steps": 0, "status": "ok", "error": null, "refused": false, "failure": null, "gate": {"blocks": 0, "searched": true, "read": false}, "warnings": [], "elapsed_s": 60.22, "answer": "Transformer 的编码器由 N=6 个完全相同的层堆叠而成。每一层包含两个子层：第一个是多头自注意力机制（multi-head self-attention），第二个是逐位置的全连接前馈网络（position-wise feed-forward network）。每个子层周围都使用了残差连接，并随后进行层归一化（LayerNorm(x + Sublayer(x))）。所有子层及嵌入层的输出维度均为 d_model = 512。", "answer_chars": 219, "truncated_answer": false, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "chk_75a31e35bdab2b4d0463", "filename": "attention-is-all-you-need.pdf", "page": 3, "model_page": 3, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_e14089dce2dc3559af73", "filename": "attention-is-all-you-need.pdf", "page": 5, "model_page": 5, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}], "citation_hit": true, "citation_count": 2, "citation_dropped": 0, "citation_dropped_ids": [], "number_coverage": 1.0, "numbers_missing": [], "trace": [{"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}], "rounds": [], "rounds_total": 0, "tool_calls_total": 2, "timing_available": false, "read_by_page": false, "legacy_harness": "tmp/agent_eval_20.py", "outcome": "ok"}
{"index": 2, "question": "Transformer 中的 Scaled Dot-Product Attention 使用什么公式？为什么要除以 √dₖ？", "answerable": true, "expected_documents": ["attention-is-all-you-need.pdf"], "expected_pages": [4], "reference_answer": "Attention(Q,K,V)=softmax(QKᵀ/√dₖ)V；除以 √dₖ 是因为 dₖ 较大时点积幅度过大，会使 softmax 进入梯度极小区域，缩放可稳定训练。", "expect": "answer", "mode": "deep", "max_steps": 0, "status": "ok", "error": null, "refused": false, "failure": null, "gate": {"blocks": 0, "searched": true, "read": false}, "warnings": [], "elapsed_s": 55.74, "answer": "Scaled Dot-Product Attention 的公式为：Attention(Q,K,V) = softmax(QKᵀ / √dₖ) V。其中 Q、K、V 分别是查询、键、值矩阵，dₖ 是键（和查询）的维度。之所以要除以 √dₖ，是因为当 dₖ 较大时，点积 QKᵀ 的数值会变得很大，从而把 softmax 函数推入梯度极小的区域（饱和区），导致梯度消失、训练困难。除以 √dₖ 可以缩放点积的幅度，抵消这一效应。", "answer_chars": 213, "truncated_answer": false, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "chk_276d5044869fa33bf242", "filename": "attention-is-all-you-need.pdf", "page": 4, "model_page": 4, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_dfd556bb4e60757c1b9d", "filename": "attention-is-all-you-need.pdf", "page": 4, "model_page": 4, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}], "citation_hit": true, "citation_count": 2, "citation_dropped": 0, "citation_dropped_ids": [], "number_coverage": null, "numbers_missing": [], "trace": [{"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}], "rounds": [], "rounds_total": 0, "tool_calls_total": 1, "timing_available": false, "read_by_page": false, "legacy_harness": "tmp/agent_eval_20.py", "outcome": "ok"}
{"index": 3, "question": "论文中 Transformer 的训练数据、硬件和训练时间分别是什么？请区分 Base 模型和 Big 模型。", "answerable": true, "expected_documents": ["attention-is-all-you-need.pdf"], "expected_pages": [7, 8], "reference_answer": "WMT 2014 English-German 约 450 万句对；8 张 NVIDIA P100 GPU；Base 训练 100,000 steps 约 12 小时，Big 训练 300,000 steps 约 3.5 天。", "expect": "answer", "mode": "deep", "max_steps": 0, "status": "ok", "error": null, "refused": false, "failure": null, "gate": {"blocks": 0, "searched": true, "read": false}, "warnings": [], "elapsed_s": 74.78, "answer": "论文（Attention Is All You Need）中 Transformer 的训练数据、硬件和训练时间如下：\n\n【训练数据】\n- 英德（English-German）：WMT 2014 英德数据集，约 450 万句对（4.5M），使用字节对编码（BPE），共享源-目标词表约 37000 个 token。\n- 英法（English-French）：WMT 2014 英法数据集，约 3600 万句（36M），使用 32000 个 word-piece 词表。\n\n【硬件】\n- Base 和 Big 模型均在一台装有 8 块 NVIDIA P100 GPU 的机器上训练。\n\n【训练时间】\n- Base 模型：每步约 0.4 秒，共训练 100,000 步，约 12 小时。\n- Big 模型：每步约 1.0 秒，共训练 300,000 步，约 3.5 天。", "answer_chars": 383, "truncated_answer": false, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "chk_a769a298382b057004f2", "filename": "attention-is-all-you-need.pdf", "page": 7, "model_page": 7, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_07a46a4294fd722e6a92", "filename": "attention-is-all-you-need.pdf", "page": 7, "model_page": 7, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}], "citation_hit": true, "citation_count": 2, "citation_dropped": 0, "citation_dropped_ids": [], "number_coverage": 1.0, "numbers_missing": [], "trace": [{"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "planned", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "planned", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}], "rounds": [], "rounds_total": 0, "tool_calls_total": 3, "timing_available": false, "read_by_page": false, "legacy_harness": "tmp/agent_eval_20.py", "outcome": "ok"}
{"index": 4, "question": "这篇论文中 Transformer 在 WMT 2014 中文到英文翻译任务上的 BLEU 分数是多少？", "answerable": false, "expected_documents": [], "expected_pages": [], "reference_answer": "", "expect": "deny", "mode": "deep", "max_steps": 0, "status": "ok", "error": null, "refused": false, "failure": null, "gate": {"blocks": 0, "searched": true, "read": true}, "warnings": [], "elapsed_s": 66.63, "answer": "这篇论文（Attention Is All You Need）中并没有报告 WMT 2014 中文到英文翻译任务的 BLEU 分数。论文只报告了两个机器翻译任务的结果：WMT 2014 英语到德语（28.4 BLEU）和 WMT 2014 英语到法语（41.0/41.8 BLEU）。文中没有中文到英文翻译任务的任何数据。", "answer_chars": 161, "truncated_answer": false, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "chk_d9a5a0e4837110c87067", "filename": "attention-is-all-you-need.pdf", "page": 8, "model_page": 8, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_d9f13f137aa041f39390", "filename": "attention-is-all-you-need.pdf", "page": 1, "model_page": 1, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}], "citation_hit": false, "citation_count": 2, "citation_dropped": 0, "citation_dropped_ids": [], "number_coverage": null, "numbers_missing": [], "trace": [{"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}], "rounds": [], "rounds_total": 0, "tool_calls_total": 3, "timing_available": false, "read_by_page": false, "legacy_harness": "tmp/agent_eval_20.py", "outcome": "deny_unverified"}
{"index": 5, "question": "BERT Cross-Encoder 为什么不适合大规模语义检索？对 10,000 个句子找最相似对需要多少次推理、约多久？SBERT 如何降低成本？", "answerable": true, "expected_documents": ["sentence-bert.pdf"], "expected_pages": [1, 2], "reference_answer": "BERT 需要把两个句子同时输入网络，组合数量随句子数呈平方增长；10,000 个句子需要 49,995,000 次推理，约 65 小时。SBERT 使用 Siamese/Triplet 网络预先为每个句子生成固定长度向量，再用余弦相似度等高效距离进行比较，将成本降到生成 10,000 个向量并建立索引，约 5 秒。", "expect": "answer", "mode": "deep", "max_steps": 0, "status": "ok", "error": null, "refused": false, "failure": null, "gate": {"blocks": 0, "searched": true, "read": false}, "warnings": [], "elapsed_s": 76.76, "answer": "BERT 的 Cross-Encoder 架构要求把两个句子同时输入网络，才能得到它们之间的相似度。因此它无法为每个句子预先计算一个独立的向量，也就无法用余弦相似度或索引结构做快速检索。对 10,000 个句子找最相似的一对，需要枚举所有两两组合，即约 50 million（约 5000 万）次推理计算，在 GPU 上约需 65 小时。SBERT 通过孪生/三元组网络结构，把每个句子单独映射成语义向量，之后只需用余弦相似度比较向量。这样只需对 10,000 个句子各做一次编码（约 5 秒），再计算余弦相似度（约 0.01 秒），把总耗时从约 65 小时降到约 5 秒，同时保持与 BERT 相当的准确率。", "answer_chars": 305, "truncated_answer": false, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "chk_afab368fe7efc3ed1372", "filename": "sentence-bert.pdf", "page": 1, "model_page": 1, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_afab368fe7efc3ed1372", "filename": "sentence-bert.pdf", "page": 1, "model_page": 1, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_b12204d197faddf129fd", "filename": "sentence-bert.pdf", "page": 2, "model_page": 2, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_3c6b7a7838c49a78d581", "filename": "sentence-bert.pdf", "page": 8, "model_page": 8, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}], "citation_hit": true, "citation_count": 4, "citation_dropped": 0, "citation_dropped_ids": [], "number_coverage": 0.75, "numbers_missing": ["49995000"], "trace": [{"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "planned", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "planned", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}], "rounds": [], "rounds_total": 0, "tool_calls_total": 2, "timing_available": false, "read_by_page": false, "legacy_harness": "tmp/agent_eval_20.py", "outcome": "ok"}
{"index": 6, "question": "SBERT 如何从 BERT 或 RoBERTa 的输出得到固定长度句向量？实验了哪些 Pooling 策略，默认策略是什么？", "answerable": true, "expected_documents": ["sentence-bert.pdf"], "expected_pages": [3], "reference_answer": "SBERT 在 BERT/RoBERTa 输出上增加 Pooling 操作得到固定长度句向量；实验了 CLS-token 输出、所有输出向量的 MEAN 和 MAX-over-time 三种策略，默认使用 MEAN。", "expect": "answer", "mode": "deep", "max_steps": 0, "status": "ok", "error": null, "refused": false, "failure": null, "gate": {"blocks": 0, "searched": true, "read": false}, "warnings": [], "elapsed_s": 68.07, "answer": "SBERT 在 BERT/RoBERTa 的输出之上增加一个 pooling 操作来得到固定长度的句向量。论文实验了三种 pooling 策略：(1) 使用 CLS-token 的输出；(2) 对所有输出向量取平均（MEAN 策略）；(3) 对所有输出向量做 max-over-time（MAX 策略）。默认配置是 MEAN。", "answer_chars": 163, "truncated_answer": false, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "chk_d4b64b39658879ae4867", "filename": "sentence-bert.pdf", "page": 3, "model_page": 3, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_2aa6122fac4d637f6ad3", "filename": "sentence-bert.pdf", "page": 4, "model_page": 4, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}], "citation_hit": true, "citation_count": 2, "citation_dropped": 0, "citation_dropped_ids": [], "number_coverage": null, "numbers_missing": [], "trace": [{"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}], "rounds": [], "rounds_total": 0, "tool_calls_total": 2, "timing_available": false, "read_by_page": false, "legacy_harness": "tmp/agent_eval_20.py", "outcome": "ok"}
{"index": 7, "question": "SBERT 的分类、回归、三元组训练目标分别如何构造？三元组损失中使用何种距离和 margin？", "answerable": true, "expected_documents": ["sentence-bert.pdf"], "expected_pages": [3], "reference_answer": "分类目标拼接 u、v 和逐元素差值 |u-v| 后接可训练权重并用 softmax 分类，使用交叉熵；回归目标使用 u、v 的余弦相似度并用均方误差；三元组目标让 anchor-positive 距离小于 anchor-negative 距离，使用欧氏距离，margin ε=1。", "expect": "answer", "mode": "deep", "max_steps": 0, "status": "ok", "error": null, "refused": true, "failure": "max_steps_without_answer", "gate": {"blocks": 0, "searched": true, "read": true}, "warnings": ["max_steps_without_answer"], "elapsed_s": 95.14, "answer": "本轮没有取到资料证据，无法给出有出处的回答。", "answer_chars": 22, "truncated_answer": false, "citations": [], "citation_hit": false, "citation_count": 0, "citation_dropped": 0, "citation_dropped_ids": [], "number_coverage": 0.0, "numbers_missing": ["1"], "trace": [{"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}], "rounds": [], "rounds_total": 0, "tool_calls_total": 9, "timing_available": false, "read_by_page": false, "legacy_harness": "tmp/agent_eval_20.py", "outcome": "budget_exhausted"}
{"index": 8, "question": "SBERT 的 NLI 训练使用哪些数据集、标签、训练轮数、batch size 和学习率？", "answerable": true, "expected_documents": ["sentence-bert.pdf"], "expected_pages": [3, 4], "reference_answer": "训练数据是 SNLI 与 MultiNLI；SNLI 标签为 contradiction、entailment 和 neutral；使用 3-way softmax 分类目标训练一个 epoch，batch size 为 16，Adam 学习率为 2e-5，并对前 10% 训练数据进行线性学习率 warm-up。", "expect": "answer", "mode": "deep", "max_steps": 0, "status": "ok", "error": null, "refused": false, "failure": null, "gate": {"blocks": 0, "searched": true, "read": true}, "warnings": [], "elapsed_s": 68.3, "answer": "SBERT 的 NLI 训练使用 SNLI（Bowman et al., 2015）与 Multi-Genre NLI / MultiNLI（Williams et al., 2018）两个数据集的组合。SNLI 包含 570,000 个句子对，MultiNLI 包含 430,000 个句子对，标签为 contradiction（矛盾）、entailment（蕴含）和 neutral（中性）三类。训练采用 3-way softmax 分类目标函数，训练 1 个 epoch，batch size 为 16，使用 Adam 优化器，学习率为 2e-5，并在前 10% 的训练数据上做线性学习率 warm-up。", "answer_chars": 306, "truncated_answer": false, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "chk_2aa6122fac4d637f6ad3", "filename": "sentence-bert.pdf", "page": 4, "model_page": 4, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_5da84b7e7422374af2a1", "filename": "sentence-bert.pdf", "page": 3, "model_page": 3, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}], "citation_hit": true, "citation_count": 2, "citation_dropped": 0, "citation_dropped_ids": [], "number_coverage": 1.0, "numbers_missing": [], "trace": [{"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "planned", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}], "rounds": [], "rounds_total": 0, "tool_calls_total": 3, "timing_available": false, "read_by_page": false, "legacy_harness": "tmp/agent_eval_20.py", "outcome": "ok"}
