{"index": 10, "question": "AFS 的 cross-topic 评测为什么比 10-fold cross-validation 更难？SBERT-AFS-large 在两种设定下的 Spearman 分数分别是多少？", "answerable": true, "expected_documents": ["sentence-bert.pdf"], "expected_pages": [5, 6], "reference_answer": "10-fold cross-validation 不能清楚反映模型对不同主题的泛化能力；cross-topic 评测用两个主题训练、在留出的第三个主题上测试，因此更难。SBERT-AFS-large 在 10-fold cross-validation 下的 Spearman 为 75.93，在 cross-topic 下为 53.10。", "expect": "answer", "mode": "deep", "max_steps": 0, "status": "ok", "error": null, "refused": false, "failure": null, "gate": {"blocks": 0, "searched": true, "read": true}, "warnings": [], "elapsed_s": 69.34, "answer": "AFS 的 cross-topic 评测比 10-fold cross-validation 更难，是因为 10-fold cross-validation 无法反映模型对不同主题（topic）的泛化能力。在 cross-topic 设定下，模型必须把来自未见主题的句子映射到向量空间，使具有相同论点（claim）和推理（reasoning）的句子彼此靠近；而 BERT 可以通过注意力机制直接逐词比较两个句子。对 SBERT 而言，这种把未见主题的句子映射到合适向量空间的任务要困难得多，因此性能明显下降（约 7 个 Spearman 点）。SBERT-AFS-large 在 10-fold cross-validation 下的 Spearman 分数为 75.93，在 cross-topic 设定下为 53.10。", "answer_chars": 362, "truncated_answer": false, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "chk_d868c0fe4112c7801748", "filename": "sentence-bert.pdf", "page": 6, "model_page": 6, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_d868c0fe4112c7801748", "filename": "sentence-bert.pdf", "page": 6, "model_page": 6, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_1a589fbed121cae2c7eb", "filename": "sentence-bert.pdf", "page": 5, "model_page": 5, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}], "citation_hit": true, "citation_count": 3, "citation_dropped": 0, "citation_dropped_ids": [], "number_coverage": 1.0, "numbers_missing": [], "trace": [{"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}], "rounds": [], "rounds_total": 0, "tool_calls_total": 3, "timing_available": false, "read_by_page": false, "legacy_harness": "tmp/agent_eval_20.py", "outcome": "ok"}
{"index": 11, "question": "Wikipedia section triplet 数据如何构造？训练和测试 triplet 数量、评价指标，以及 SBERT-WikiSec-large 的准确率是什么？", "answerable": true, "expected_documents": ["sentence-bert.pdf"], "expected_pages": [6], "reference_answer": "Anchor 和 positive 来自同一篇 Wikipedia 文章的同一章节，negative 来自同一文章的不同章节；训练集约 180 万个 triplet，测试集 222,957 个 triplet；评价指标是 positive 是否比 negative 更接近 anchor 的准确率；SBERT-WikiSec-large 的准确率为 0.8078。", "expect": "answer", "mode": "deep", "max_steps": 0, "status": "ok", "error": null, "refused": false, "failure": null, "gate": {"blocks": 0, "searched": true, "read": true}, "warnings": [], "elapsed_s": 72.76, "answer": "Wikipedia section triplet 数据由 Dor et al. (2018) 构造：将 Wikipedia 文章按主题细分为不同 section，假设同一 section 内的句子在主题上比不同 section 的句子更接近，据此构造弱标注的句子三元组——anchor 与 positive 来自同一 section，negative 来自同一篇文章的不同 section。SBERT 使用 Triplet Objective，在约 180 万（1.8 Million）个训练三元组上训练一个 epoch，并在 222,957 个测试三元组上评估（测试三元组来自不同的 Wikipedia 文章集合）。评价指标为准确率（accuracy），即判断 positive 是否比 negative 更接近 anchor。SBERT-WikiSec-large 的准确率为 0.8078。", "answer_chars": 399, "truncated_answer": false, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "chk_0be0495ec19d70b9dfaf", "filename": "sentence-bert.pdf", "page": 5, "model_page": 5, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_c46b02951bf80e05c182", "filename": "sentence-bert.pdf", "page": 6, "model_page": 6, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_304c4502a651014a67e8", "filename": "sentence-bert.pdf", "page": 6, "model_page": 6, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}], "citation_hit": true, "citation_count": 3, "citation_dropped": 0, "citation_dropped_ids": [], "number_coverage": 1.0, "numbers_missing": [], "trace": [{"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "planned", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}], "rounds": [], "rounds_total": 0, "tool_calls_total": 3, "timing_available": false, "read_by_page": false, "legacy_harness": "tmp/agent_eval_20.py", "outcome": "ok"}
{"index": 12, "question": "Sentence-BERT 论文是否报告了它在中文语义文本相似度基准上的平均 Spearman 分数？", "answerable": false, "expected_documents": [], "expected_pages": [], "reference_answer": "", "expect": "deny", "mode": "deep", "max_steps": 0, "status": "ok", "error": null, "refused": false, "failure": null, "gate": {"blocks": 0, "searched": true, "read": false}, "warnings": [], "elapsed_s": 68.91, "answer": "没有。Sentence-BERT 论文报告的语义文本相似度（STS）基准均为英文数据集（STS12–STS16、STSb、SICK-R），论文中并未报告任何中文语义文本相似度基准上的平均 Spearman 分数。", "answer_chars": 106, "truncated_answer": false, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "chk_3add1cc1deadb7d29bb2", "filename": "sentence-bert.pdf", "page": 4, "model_page": 4, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_0f071c1cbd76e480657f", "filename": "sentence-bert.pdf", "page": 4, "model_page": 4, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}], "citation_hit": false, "citation_count": 2, "citation_dropped": 0, "citation_dropped_ids": [], "number_coverage": null, "numbers_missing": [], "trace": [{"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}], "rounds": [], "rounds_total": 0, "tool_calls_total": 2, "timing_available": false, "read_by_page": false, "legacy_harness": "tmp/agent_eval_20.py", "outcome": "deny_unverified"}
{"index": 13, "question": "RAG 中参数化记忆与非参数化记忆分别是什么？检索器和生成器各采用什么预训练模型？", "answerable": true, "expected_documents": ["retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf"], "expected_pages": [1, 2, 3], "reference_answer": "参数化记忆是预训练的序列到序列生成模型，论文使用 BART；非参数化记忆是 Wikipedia 的稠密向量文档索引，由预训练神经检索器访问；检索器使用 DPR，生成器使用 BART-large。", "expect": "answer", "mode": "deep", "max_steps": 0, "status": "ok", "error": null, "refused": false, "failure": null, "gate": {"blocks": 0, "searched": true, "read": false}, "warnings": [], "elapsed_s": 70.02, "answer": "在 RAG（Retrieval-Augmented Generation）中，参数化记忆（parametric memory）指存储在模型可训练参数中的知识，即预训练的 seq2seq 生成器（BART）本身；非参数化记忆（non-parametric memory）指不依赖模型参数、可被直接检索和更新的外部知识库，即 Wikipedia 的稠密向量索引（dense vector index）。检索器（retriever）采用预训练的 Dense Passage Retriever（DPR，基于 BERT-base 的 query/document 编码器），生成器（generator）采用预训练的 seq2seq transformer BART-large。", "answer_chars": 335, "truncated_answer": false, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "chk_94b094b64ce065fcdb5a", "filename": "retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf", "page": 2, "model_page": 2, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_c9c6b636db6808717ea3", "filename": "retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf", "page": 3, "model_page": 3, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_bd709df52a0c3dff0d1c", "filename": "retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf", "page": 18, "model_page": 18, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}], "citation_hit": true, "citation_count": 3, "citation_dropped": 0, "citation_dropped_ids": [], "number_coverage": null, "numbers_missing": [], "trace": [{"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}], "rounds": [], "rounds_total": 0, "tool_calls_total": 2, "timing_available": false, "read_by_page": false, "legacy_harness": "tmp/agent_eval_20.py", "outcome": "ok"}
{"index": 14, "question": "RAG-Sequence 和 RAG-Token 在一条输出序列中使用检索文档的方式有什么区别？什么情况下二者等价？", "answerable": true, "expected_documents": ["retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf"], "expected_pages": [3], "reference_answer": "RAG-Sequence 对整条输出序列使用同一个文档；RAG-Token 可以为每个目标 token 使用不同的潜在文档。对于序列分类任务，目标类别可视为长度为 1 的目标序列，此时二者等价。", "expect": "answer", "mode": "deep", "max_steps": 0, "status": "ok", "error": null, "refused": false, "failure": null, "gate": {"blocks": 0, "searched": true, "read": true}, "warnings": [], "elapsed_s": 73.64, "answer": "RAG-Sequence 与 RAG-Token 的区别在于对检索文档（潜在变量 z）做边缘化（marginalize）的方式不同。RAG-Sequence 在整个输出序列 y 的生成过程中使用同一个检索文档：它先对每个文档 z 计算整条序列的概率 p_θ(y|x,z)，再按检索概率 p_η(z|x) 加权求和，即 p(y|x) ≈ Σ_z p_η(z|x) ∏_i p_θ(y_i|x,z,y_{1:i-1})。而 RAG-Token 允许每个目标 token 使用不同的检索文档：对每个 token 位置 i 分别对文档做边缘化，即 p(y|x) ≈ ∏_i Σ_z p_η(z|x) p_θ(y_i|x,z,y_{1:i-1})，因此生成器可以在生成答案时从多个文档中选取内容。二者等价的情形是：当把目标类别视为长度为 1 的目标序列（即序列分类任务）时，RAG-Sequence 与 RAG-Token 等价，因为此时序列只有一个 token，逐 token 边缘化与整条序列边缘化退化为同一操作。", "answer_chars": 454, "truncated_answer": false, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "chk_c3cf1dd602f1b693fe6a", "filename": "retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf", "page": 2, "model_page": 2, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_20dde58762c515eaa50f", "filename": "retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf", "page": 3, "model_page": 3, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_bb627d3c57c8752ddb6a", "filename": "retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf", "page": 3, "model_page": 3, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}], "citation_hit": true, "citation_count": 3, "citation_dropped": 0, "citation_dropped_ids": [], "number_coverage": 1.0, "numbers_missing": [], "trace": [{"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}], "rounds": [], "rounds_total": 0, "tool_calls_total": 4, "timing_available": false, "read_by_page": false, "legacy_harness": "tmp/agent_eval_20.py", "outcome": "ok"}
{"index": 15, "question": "RAG 的 DPR 检索器是什么架构？查询与文档如何编码，Top-K 检索被建模成什么问题？", "answerable": true, "expected_documents": ["retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf"], "expected_pages": [3], "reference_answer": "DPR 使用 bi-encoder 架构；文档表示 d(z) 由 BERT 文档编码器生成，查询表示 q(x) 由 BERT 查询编码器生成，二者都是 BERT-base；按查询和文档向量内积的概率选择 Top-K 文档，本质上是 Maximum Inner Product Search（MIPS）问题。", "expect": "answer", "mode": "deep", "max_steps": 0, "status": "ok", "error": null, "refused": false, "failure": null, "gate": {"blocks": 0, "searched": true, "read": true}, "warnings": [], "elapsed_s": 66.06, "answer": "RAG 中的 DPR 检索器采用 bi-encoder（双编码器）架构：查询和文档分别由两个独立的 BERT_BASE 编码器编码成稠密向量。具体地，文档表示 d(z) 由 BERT_BASE 文档编码器产生，查询表示 q(x) 由同样基于 BERT_BASE 的查询编码器产生。检索概率定义为 p_η(z|x) ∝ exp(d(z)ᵀ q(x))，即文档向量与查询向量的内积经指数归一化。Top-K 检索（取 p_η(·|x) 最高的 k 个文档）被建模成一个 Maximum Inner Product Search（MIPS，最大内积搜索）问题，可在亚线性时间内近似求解。该预训练 bi-encoder 用 TriviaQA 和 Natural Questions 训练，用于初始化检索器并构建文档索引（即非参数记忆）。", "answer_chars": 363, "truncated_answer": false, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "chk_d62e14122e9f90910c24", "filename": "retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf", "page": 3, "model_page": 3, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_5d6eee07e9efe516f938", "filename": "retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf", "page": 3, "model_page": 3, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}], "citation_hit": true, "citation_count": 2, "citation_dropped": 0, "citation_dropped_ids": [], "number_coverage": null, "numbers_missing": [], "trace": [{"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}], "rounds": [], "rounds_total": 0, "tool_calls_total": 4, "timing_available": false, "read_by_page": false, "legacy_harness": "tmp/agent_eval_20.py", "outcome": "ok"}
{"index": 16, "question": "RAG 端到端训练时，论文为什么固定 document encoder 和文档索引？实际微调了哪些组件？", "answerable": true, "expected_documents": ["retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf"], "expected_pages": [4], "reference_answer": "更新 document encoder 会要求像 REALM 预训练时一样周期性重建文档索引，成本很高；论文认为这不是取得强效果所必需的，因此固定 document encoder 和索引，只微调 query encoder BERTq 与 BART generator。", "expect": "answer", "mode": "deep", "max_steps": 0, "status": "ok", "error": null, "refused": false, "failure": null, "gate": {"blocks": 0, "searched": true, "read": false}, "warnings": [], "elapsed_s": 62.83, "answer": "论文固定 document encoder（BERT_d）和文档索引，是因为在训练过程中更新 document encoder 代价很高：一旦更新它，就需要像 REALM 预训练那样周期性重建文档索引。作者发现这一步对取得强性能并非必要，因此保持 document encoder 和索引固定，只微调 query encoder（BERT_q）和 BART generator。", "answer_chars": 189, "truncated_answer": false, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "chk_e09712bf56a7a7b40603", "filename": "retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf", "page": 3, "model_page": 3, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}], "citation_hit": false, "citation_count": 1, "citation_dropped": 0, "citation_dropped_ids": [], "number_coverage": null, "numbers_missing": [], "trace": [{"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}], "rounds": [], "rounds_total": 0, "tool_calls_total": 2, "timing_available": false, "read_by_page": false, "legacy_harness": "tmp/agent_eval_20.py", "outcome": "adjacent_page"}
{"index": 17, "question": "RAG-Sequence 的 Thorough Decoding 与 Fast Decoding 有什么区别？Fast Decoding 使用什么近似来提高效率？", "answerable": true, "expected_documents": ["retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf"], "expected_pages": [4], "reference_answer": "Thorough Decoding 为每个检索文档执行 beam search，并对没有在某文档 beam 中出现的候选额外前向计算，再汇总边际概率；Fast Decoding 假设未在该文档 beam search 中生成的候选 y 的生成概率近似为 0，从而省去额外前向计算。", "expect": "answer", "mode": "deep", "max_steps": 0, "status": "ok", "error": null, "refused": true, "failure": "max_steps_without_answer", "gate": {"blocks": 0, "searched": true, "read": true}, "warnings": ["max_steps_without_answer"], "elapsed_s": 69.03, "answer": "本轮没有取到资料证据，无法给出有出处的回答。", "answer_chars": 22, "truncated_answer": false, "citations": [], "citation_hit": false, "citation_count": 0, "citation_dropped": 0, "citation_dropped_ids": [], "number_coverage": 0.0, "numbers_missing": ["0"], "trace": [{"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": false, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}], "rounds": [], "rounds_total": 0, "tool_calls_total": 6, "timing_available": false, "read_by_page": false, "legacy_harness": "tmp/agent_eval_20.py", "outcome": "budget_exhausted"}
{"index": 18, "question": "RAG 的实验使用哪一版 Wikipedia，如何切块，共有多少个文档，使用什么索引和近似检索结构？", "answerable": true, "expected_documents": ["retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf"], "expected_pages": [4], "reference_answer": "实验使用 2018 年 12 月的 Wikipedia dump；每篇文章切成互不重叠的 100-word chunks；总计 21M 个文档；使用文档编码器生成向量，建立 FAISS 的 MIPS 索引，并使用 Hierarchical Navigable Small World 近似结构加速检索。", "expect": "answer", "mode": "deep", "max_steps": 0, "status": "ok", "error": null, "refused": false, "failure": null, "gate": {"blocks": 0, "searched": true, "read": false}, "warnings": [], "elapsed_s": 66.52, "answer": "RAG 实验使用 December 2018 版 Wikipedia dump 作为非参数知识源。每篇 Wikipedia 文章被切分为互不重叠的 100 词块（disjoint 100-word chunks），共得到 21M（2100 万）个文档。使用文档编码器为每个文档计算嵌入，并用 FAISS 构建一个单一的 MIPS（最大内积搜索）索引，采用 Hierarchical Navigable Small World（HNSW）近似结构进行快速检索。", "answer_chars": 229, "truncated_answer": false, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "chk_ca47b378bff177675df7", "filename": "retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf", "page": 4, "model_page": 4, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}], "citation_hit": true, "citation_count": 1, "citation_dropped": 0, "citation_dropped_ids": [], "number_coverage": 0.75, "numbers_missing": ["12"], "trace": [{"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}], "rounds": [], "rounds_total": 0, "tool_calls_total": 2, "timing_available": false, "read_by_page": false, "legacy_harness": "tmp/agent_eval_20.py", "outcome": "ok"}
{"index": 19, "question": "在 NQ、TriviaQA、WebQuestions 和 CuratedTrec 上，RAG-Token 与 RAG-Sequence 的 Exact Match 分数分别是多少？", "answerable": true, "expected_documents": ["retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf"], "expected_pages": [6], "reference_answer": "RAG-Token 的 Exact Match 分数依次为 NQ 44.1、TriviaQA 55.2/66.1、WebQuestions 45.5、CuratedTrec 50.0；RAG-Sequence 依次为 NQ 44.5、TriviaQA 56.8/68.0、WebQuestions 45.2、CuratedTrec 52.2。", "expect": "answer", "mode": "deep", "max_steps": 0, "status": "ok", "error": null, "refused": false, "failure": null, "gate": {"blocks": 0, "searched": true, "read": true}, "warnings": [], "elapsed_s": 73.31, "answer": "在 NQ、TriviaQA、WebQuestions 和 CuratedTrec 四个开放域问答数据集上，RAG-Token 与 RAG-Sequence 的 Exact Match 分数如下（TriviaQA 左列为标准测试集，右列为 TQA-Wiki 测试集）：\n\nRAG-Token：NQ 44.1，TriviaQA 55.2 / 66.1，WebQuestions 45.5，CuratedTrec 50.0。\nRAG-Sequence：NQ 44.5，TriviaQA 56.8 / 68.0，WebQuestions 45.2，CuratedTrec 52.2。", "answer_chars": 287, "truncated_answer": false, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "chk_9795ffdf048c05912cc0", "filename": "retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf", "page": 6, "model_page": 6, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_9795ffdf048c05912cc0", "filename": "retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf", "page": 6, "model_page": 6, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}], "citation_hit": true, "citation_count": 2, "citation_dropped": 0, "citation_dropped_ids": [], "number_coverage": 1.0, "numbers_missing": [], "trace": [{"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "read", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": null, "provider": null, "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}], "rounds": [], "rounds_total": 0, "tool_calls_total": 3, "timing_available": false, "read_