{"index": 20, "question": "RAG 论文是否报告了它在 MMLU 基准上的准确率？", "answerable": false, "expected_documents": [], "expected_pages": [], "reference_answer": "", "expect": "deny", "mode": "deep", "max_steps": 0, "status": "ok", "error": null, "refused": false, "failure": null, "gate": {"blocks": 0, "searched": true, "read": false}, "warnings": [], "elapsed_s": 78.73, "answer": "没有。RAG 论文（retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf）的实验部分（第 4 节 Results）报告了开放域问答（Natural Questions、TriviaQA、WebQuestions、CuratedTrec）、抽象式问答（MSMARCO）、Jeopardy 问题生成、事实验证（FEVER）以及消融实验等结果，全文检索中未出现 MMLU（Massive Multitask Language Understanding）基准，也未报告任何 MMLU 准确率。", "answer_chars": 251, "truncated_answer": false, "citations": [{"chunk_id": "chk_2396f2f7af3e6d9d89c9", "filename": "retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf", "page": 6, "model_page": 6, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}, {"chunk_id": "chk_a32d27e870e2b7522262", "filename": "retrieval-augmented-generation.pdf", "page": 8, "model_page": 8, "page_fidelity": null, "quote": ""}], "citation_hit": false, "citation_count": 2, "citation_dropped": 0, "citation_dropped_ids": [], "number_coverage": null, "numbers_missing": [], "trace": [{"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}, {"round": null, "tool": "search", "arguments": {}, "ok": true, "error": null, "track": "direct", "provider": "llm", "offset_s": null, "duration_s": null}], "rounds": [], "rounds_total": 0, "tool_calls_total": 4, "timing_available": false, "read_by_page": false, "legacy_harness": "tmp/agent_eval_20.py", "outcome": "deny_unverified"}
